### 密码登录
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "devcircle"
}

### GitHub OAuth2 mock 回调
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/oauth2/callback/github?code=demo-code&state=devcircle

### 刷新令牌
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "replace-with-refresh-token"
}

### 推荐流
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommend/feed?scene=home&size=3
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo

### 图片流
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommend/feed?scene=image&size=3
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo

### 视频流
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommend/feed?scene=video&size=3
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo

### 推荐曝光
POST http://localhost:8080/api/recommend/exposures
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "postIds": [1001, 1003],
  "scene": "home_feed"
}

### 帖子列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts?type=IMAGE
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo

### 创建图片帖子
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "IMAGE",
  "title": "Elasticsearch 搜索索引设计图解",
  "content": "用多图说明字段映射、标签过滤、排序和补偿重建策略。",
  "tags": ["Elasticsearch", "搜索"],
  "mediaIds": [201, 202]
}

### 上传媒体，REST Client 需选择本地文件
POST http://localhost:8080/api/files
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cover.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./cover.png
--boundary--

### 点赞，带幂等键
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts/1001/like
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo
Idempotency-Key: like-1001-demo

### 收藏，带幂等键
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts/1001/favorite
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo
Idempotency-Key: favorite-1001-demo

### 关注用户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/42/follow
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo

### 用户二跳推荐
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/2/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo

### 搜索
GET http://localhost:8080/api/search/posts?keyword=Spring
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-demo

### 重建搜索索引
POST http://localhost:8080/api/search/admin/reindex
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-admin

### 发布 Outbox 事件
POST http://localhost:8080/api/content/admin/outbox/publish?batchSize=100
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-admin

### 审核列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/audits/posts
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-admin

### 审核通过
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/audits/posts/1002/approve
Authorization: Bearer demo-access-token-admin
